## 按钮样式规范

### 正常样式（主操作）
蓝底白字，用于主要确认、提交等操作：

```objective-c
UIButton *primaryButton = [UIButton buttonWithType:UIButtonTypeCustom];
primaryButton.backgroundColor = Color_blue;
[primaryButton setTitleColor:[UIColor whiteColor] forState:UIControlStateNormal];
primaryButton.titleLabel.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:14.0f];
primaryButton.layer.cornerRadius = 4.0f;
[primaryButton setTitle:@"确认" forState:UIControlStateNormal];
```

### 异常样式（危险操作）
红底白字，用于删除、警告等危险操作：

```objective-c
UIButton *dangerButton = [UIButton buttonWithType:UIButtonTypeCustom];
dangerButton.backgroundColor = Color_red;
[dangerButton setTitleColor:[UIColor whiteColor] forState:UIControlStateNormal];
dangerButton.titleLabel.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:14.0f];
dangerButton.layer.cornerRadius = 4.0f;
[dangerButton setTitle:@"删除" forState:UIControlStateNormal];
```

### 取消样式（次要操作）
白底黑字，带边框，用于取消、返回等次要操作：

- **大/中号按钮** borderWidth：`1.5pt`
- **小号按钮** borderWidth：`1pt`

```objective-c
// 大/中号取消按钮（borderWidth = 1.5）
UIButton *cancelButton = [UIButton buttonWithType:UIButtonTypeCustom];
cancelButton.backgroundColor = [UIColor whiteColor];
cancelButton.layer.borderColor = Color_border.CGColor;
cancelButton.layer.borderWidth = 1.5f;
[cancelButton setTitleColor:ColorText_0 forState:UIControlStateNormal];
cancelButton.titleLabel.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:14.0f];
cancelButton.layer.cornerRadius = 4.0f;
[cancelButton setTitle:@"取消" forState:UIControlStateNormal];

// 小号取消按钮（borderWidth = 1）
UIButton *smallCancelButton = [UIButton buttonWithType:UIButtonTypeCustom];
smallCancelButton.backgroundColor = [UIColor whiteColor];
smallCancelButton.layer.borderColor = Color_border.CGColor;
smallCancelButton.layer.borderWidth = 1.0f;
[smallCancelButton setTitleColor:ColorText_0 forState:UIControlStateNormal];
smallCancelButton.titleLabel.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:12.0f];
smallCancelButton.layer.cornerRadius = 4.0f;
[smallCancelButton setTitle:@"取消" forState:UIControlStateNormal];
```

