## 特殊文字链接按钮（需询问确认后使用）

### 适用场景
文字+箭头图标组合的轻量链接入口（如"详情 >"），不使用普通 `UIButton`，而是用 `UILabel` + `UIImageView` + 透明 `UIButton` 叠加实现，以便更灵活地控制文字和图标的布局。

> **注意**：此类按钮样式特殊，使用前需向设计确认是否采用此方案。

### 实现方式

```objective-c
// 文字标签
UILabel *detailLabel = [[UILabel alloc] init];
detailLabel.backgroundColor = [UIColor clearColor];
detailLabel.text = @"详情";
detailLabel.textAlignment = NSTextAlignmentRight;
detailLabel.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:12];
detailLabel.textColor = Color_blue;
[self addSubview:detailLabel];

// 箭头图标
UIImageView *arrowImgView = [[UIImageView alloc] init];
arrowImgView.contentMode = UIViewContentModeScaleAspectFit;
arrowImgView.image = [UIImage imageNamed:@"icon_arrow_right_blue"];
[self addSubview:arrowImgView];

// 透明点击区域覆盖在标签+图标上方
UIButton *detailButton = [UIButton buttonWithType:UIButtonTypeCustom];
[detailButton addTarget:self action:@selector(detailButtonClick) forControlEvents:UIControlEventTouchUpInside];
[self addSubview:detailButton];

// 约束（参考 SFAMakeWangHomeLittleTitleView）
[arrowImgView mas_makeConstraints:^(MASConstraintMaker *make) {
    make.centerY.mas_equalTo(detailLabel);
    make.right.mas_offset(-14);
    make.width.mas_equalTo(6);
    make.height.mas_equalTo(10);
}];

[detailLabel mas_makeConstraints:^(MASConstraintMaker *make) {
    make.centerY.mas_equalTo(arrowImgView);
    make.right.mas_equalTo(arrowImgView.mas_left).mas_offset(-3);
    make.height.mas_equalTo(15);
}];

[detailButton mas_makeConstraints:^(MASConstraintMaker *make) {
    make.right.mas_offset(0);
    make.width.mas_equalTo(60);
    make.height.mas_equalTo(30);
    make.centerY.mas_equalTo(detailLabel);
}];
```

